---
import { useTranslations } from '../i18n/utils';
const i18n = {
  fi: {
      'Why choose': 'Miksi valita',
      'Free and Open Source Software?': 'vapaa ja avoin lähdekoodi?',
      'Take back control of your software. Avoid vendor lock-ins and greedy service providers. Make the world more transparent while saving money.': 'Palauta ohjelmisto-oikeudet kansalaisille. Vältä toimittajaloukut ja ahneet järjestelmätoimittajat. Edistä läpinäkyvyyttä säästäen samalla selvää rahaa.',
      'No vendor lock-ins': 'Ei toimittajaloukkuja',
      'Stuck with a bad software vendor? Switch providers without changing the software. Avoid unreasonable rising costs and say no to closed source vendors regularly retiring old proprietary systems and forcing you to "upgrade" to their latest product.': 'Sattuiko kohdallesi huono järjestelmätoimittaja? Vaihda järjestelmän toimittajaa vaihtamatta itse järjestelmää. Vältä perusteettomat hintojenkorotukset ja kaupallisten ohjelmistotoimittajien kierot tavat lopettaa hankkimasi ohjelmiston päivittäminen ennenaikaisesti, jättäen ainoaksi vaihtoehdoksi "päivityksen" saman toimittajan uusimpaan tuotteeseen.',
      'See under the hood': 'Kurkkaa konepellin alle',
      'Privacy policies, while important, can sometimes be vague, incomplete or even false. We need an explicit source for learning how data collection is implemented. That is the code itself. Freedom to audit software, at any time and free of charge, enables more transparency.': 'Tietosuojaselosteet ovat tärkeitä, mutta joskus ne voivat olla ympäripyöreitä, puutteellisia tai jopa virheellisiä. Henkilötietojen keräysmenetelmien dokumentointiin on olemassa täsmällisempi lähde - itse ohjelmakoodi. Vapaus auditoida ohjelmistoja milloin tahansa ja ilman ylimääräisiä kustannuksia mahdollistaa läpinäkyvämmän järjestelmäpalvelun tarjoamisen.',
      'Cost-effective': 'Kustannustehokkuus',
      'Free and Open Source Software developers publish code making it available to everyone in the world. Sharing new features, bugfixes, translations and documentation thus sharing workload in an open community means lower costs for everyone. No need to reinvent the wheel over and over again.': 'Vapaan ja avoimen lähdekoodin ohjelmistokehittäjät jakavat koodinsa kaikille avoimena. Uusien ominaisuuksien, bugikorjausten, käännösten ja dokumentaation jakaminen tarkoittaa matalempia kehitys- ja käyttökustannuksia. Oma yhteisölle antamasi työpanos palautuu moninkertaisena takaisin.'
  }
} as i18n;
const t = useTranslations(i18n);
---

<section id="whyfoss" class="py-32 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-[#0c0c0f] border-y border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle dark background glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-zinc-200/50 via-transparent to-transparent dark:from-primary-900/10 dark:via-transparent dark:to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        {t('Why choose')} <br/><span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">{t('Free and Open Source Software?')}</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
        {t('Take back control of your software. Avoid vendor lock-ins and greedy service providers. Make the world more transparent while saving money.')}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-rows-[minmax(260px,auto)_minmax(280px,auto)] gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col hover-glow reveal-on-scroll relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[420px] lg:min-h-0">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-950 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-300 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
	<g>
		<path d="M409.6,204.8h-256V128c0-56.559,45.841-102.4,102.4-102.4S358.4,71.441,358.4,128H384C384,57.421,326.579,0,256,0    S128,57.421,128,128v76.8h-25.6c-14.14,0-25.6,11.46-25.6,25.6v256c0,14.14,11.46,25.6,25.6,25.6h307.2    c14.14,0,25.6-11.46,25.6-25.6v-256C435.2,216.26,423.74,204.8,409.6,204.8z M409.6,486.4H102.4v-256h307.2V486.4z"/>
	</g>
	<g>
		<path d="M256,307.2c-21.171,0-38.4,17.229-38.4,38.4c0,16.666,10.735,30.737,25.6,36.045V422.4h25.6v-40.755    c14.865-5.299,25.6-19.379,25.6-36.045C294.4,324.429,277.171,307.2,256,307.2z M256,358.4c-7.066,0-12.8-5.734-12.8-12.8    c0-7.066,5.734-12.8,12.8-12.8c7.066,0,12.8,5.734,12.8,12.8C268.8,352.666,263.066,358.4,256,358.4z"/>
	</g>
</svg>`} />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 z-10">{t('No vendor lock-ins')}</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow z-10">
          {t('Stuck with a bad software vendor? Switch providers without changing the software. Avoid unreasonable rising costs and say no to closed source vendors regularly retiring old proprietary systems and forcing you to "upgrade" to their latest product.')}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col hover-glow reveal-on-scroll min-h-[320px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-accent-600 dark:text-zinc-400  rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>`} />
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 z-10">{t('See under the hood')}</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow z-10">
          {t('Privacy policies, while important, can sometimes be vague, incomplete or even false. We need an explicit source for learning how data collection is implemented. That is the code itself. Freedom to audit software, at any time and free of charge, enables more transparency.')}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col hover-glow reveal-on-scroll min-h-[320px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-accent-600 dark:text-green-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54px" height="54px" viewBox="-9 0 32 32" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11.040 20.96c-0.6 0.24-1.2 0.32-1.84 0.32-2.12 0-3.92-1.24-4.76-3h4.72c0.48 0 0.84-0.4 0.84-0.84s-0.4-0.84-0.84-0.84h-5.24c-0.040-0.2-0.040-0.4-0.040-0.6s0-0.4 0.040-0.6h5.24c0.48 0 0.84-0.4 0.84-0.84s-0.4-0.84-0.84-0.84h-4.76c0.88-1.76 2.68-3 4.76-3 0.6 0 1.24 0.12 1.84 0.32 0.44 0.16 0.92-0.080 1.080-0.52s-0.080-0.92-0.52-1.080c-0.8-0.28-1.6-0.44-2.44-0.44-3.080 0-5.68 1.96-6.6 4.72h-1.68c-0.48 0-0.84 0.4-0.84 0.84s0.4 0.84 0.84 0.84h1.36c0 0.2-0.040 0.4-0.040 0.6s0 0.4 0.040 0.6h-1.36c-0.48 0-0.84 0.4-0.84 0.84s0.4 0.84 0.84 0.84h1.72c0.96 2.72 3.56 4.72 6.6 4.72 0.84 0 1.64-0.16 2.44-0.44 0.44-0.16 0.68-0.64 0.52-1.080s-0.64-0.68-1.080-0.52z"></path></svg>`} />
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 z-10">{t('Cost-effective')}</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow z-10">
          {t('Free and Open Source Software developers publish code making it available to everyone in the world. Sharing new features, bugfixes, translations and documentation thus sharing workload in an open community means lower costs for everyone. No need to reinvent the wheel over and over again.')}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
